    "Something went wrong with the reply. Try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "حدث خطأ في الرد. حاول مرة أخرى."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Something went wrong with the reply. Try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "إيقاف"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell me what’s on your heart. I’ll listen, and share duas and verses that may bring you calm, shown in the app’s own verified text.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "أخبرني بما في قلبك. سأستمع إليك، وأشاركك أدعية وآيات قد تبعث فيك الطمأنينة، تظهر بنصّ التطبيق الموثّق."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tell me what’s on your heart. I’ll listen, and share duas and verses that may bring you calm, shown in the app’s own verified text."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The companion couldn’t answer that. Try saying it another way.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لم يستطع الرفيق الإجابة عن ذلك. جرّب أن تقوله بطريقة أخرى."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The companion couldn’t answer that. Try saying it another way."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The companion uses Claude, an AI made by Anthropic. It needs an API key from your own Anthropic account, and what it costs is billed there: usually a few cents a conversation, rarely more than 20 cents.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يعمل الرفيق بـ Claude، وهو ذكاء اصطناعي من Anthropic. يحتاج إلى مفتاح API من حسابك في Anthropic، وتُحتسب تكلفته على ذلك الحساب: عادةً بضعة سنتات للمحادثة، ونادرًا ما تتجاوز ٢٠ سنتًا."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The companion uses Claude, an AI made by Anthropic. It needs an API key from your own Anthropic account, and what it costs is billed there: usually a few cents a conversation, rarely more than 20 cents."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key couldn’t be saved. Try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تعذّر حفظ المفتاح. حاول مرة أخرى."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The key couldn’t be saved. Try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يفكّر…"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thinking…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try again": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "حاول مرة أخرى"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you write to the companion is sent to Anthropic to get a reply. Your conversations are saved on this iPhone and in your backups, and left out of the spreadsheet export.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ما تكتبه للرفيق يُرسل إلى Anthropic للحصول على الرد. تُحفظ محادثاتك على هذا الآيفون وفي نسخك الاحتياطية، ولا تدخل في ملف الجدول المُصدَّر."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you write to the companion is sent to Anthropic to get a reply. Your conversations are saved on this iPhone and in your backups, and left out of the spreadsheet export."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write what’s on your heart": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "اكتب ما في قلبك"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write what’s on your heart"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your API key": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "مفتاح API"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your API key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your API key wasn’t accepted. Check it, or create a new one in the Anthropic Console.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لم يُقبل مفتاح API. تحقّق منه أو أنشئ مفتاحًا جديدًا في Anthropic Console."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your API key wasn’t accepted. Check it, or create a new one in the Anthropic Console."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Anthropic account has reached its limit or is out of credit. Wait a moment, or check billing in the Anthropic Console.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "بلغ حسابك في Anthropic حدّه أو نفد رصيده. انتظر قليلًا أو راجع الفوترة في Anthropic Console."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Anthropic account has reached its limit or is out of credit. Wait a moment, or check billing in the Anthropic Console."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
